  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f1c40f\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1469978/description_5f399f0e-4fbb-4016-85ce-5780cd0e0806.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"253\"></em></strong></span></h1>\n<hr>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong style=\"color:#236fa1\"><em>加入 Discord 伺服器以獲取更新與獨家前瞻內容！</em></strong></h4>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong><em>點擊下方</em></strong></span></h2>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);color:#e5e5e5;font-size:16px\" href=\"https://discord.gg/DFMKqNXXgD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1403371/description_7b8ddf74-b435-44d7-bc57-bb8423a3c54b.png\" alt=\"加入 Discord 伺服器\" width=\"120\" height=\"62\"></a></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);color:#e5e5e5;font-size:16px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpkfl_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1559050/description_1cf475c9-5bdd-4f2b-af2a-1865f9102837.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"216\" height=\"59\"></a></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>按下 [<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">T]</span> 停止所有聲音／噪音／音樂（GUI 介面）</strong></em></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>本模組特色：</strong></em></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>實驗 1160：<span style=\"color:#7c0f06\">BOXY BOO</span></strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>實驗 1006：<span style=\"color:#c155d0\">THE PROTOTYPE</span></strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff1b07\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">實驗 1354：</span> <span style=\"color:#1c4c4f\">HARLEY SAWYER</span></span></strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>實驗 1170：<span style=\"color:#080ae3\">HUGGY WUGGY</span></strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>實驗 1171：<span style=\"color:#f21818\">CHUM CHOMPKINS</span></strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>實驗 1172：<span style=\"color:#843fa1\">KISSY MISSY</span></strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>實驗 1202：<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">GIBLET</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p><em><span style=\"color:#fc0d0d\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">提示</span>：若想讓 GIBLET 停止跟隨你，請在聊天視窗輸入「stop following me」或「follow me」。按下 Y 鍵可給予 GIBLET 物品；若給予他箱子，則按 G 鍵開啟箱子！</strong></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span style=\"color:#fc0d0d\"><strong>/poppyplaytimeconfig</strong></span></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_14ff1382-bc4e-419e-9a2f-27317745a01a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"319\" height=\"112\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#04fb6b\">需要安裝 GeckoLib</span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ff1b07\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1469978/description_e4910591-0000-4493-a390-8307f6042ea2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"80\" height=\"51\"></span></p>\n<blockquote><hr></blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ff1b07\">歡迎前往查看我的最新恐怖模組！：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/in-7-days-to-live\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/in-7-days-to-live</a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>新增隱藏彩蛋，提示：爆炸、Limon</p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1469978/description_e91aec90-6d27-4341-9e32-3c26a3984c10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"676\" height=\"414\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">配方 #1 VHS 錄影帶</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1469978/description_66c2ef12-39f7-4da6-bbd6-7a79cc61b31c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"141\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">配方 #2 Limon 方塊</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1469978/description_87a30ca6-904b-4dcd-94fd-a6b829831190.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"141\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
